Discussion Before Implementation

Before implementing any solution, you MUST discuss:

Overall approach and strategy
- Explain your proposed solution at a high level
- Present the reasoning behind your approach

Trade-offs and alternatives
- Suggest alternative approaches if they exist
- Explain pros and cons of each option
- Recommend which approach you think is best and why

Potential edge cases and problems
- Identify possible failure scenarios
- Discuss error handling strategy
- Point out assumptions being made

Impact analysis
- List which files or components will be affected
- Highlight any dependencies or ripple effects
- Mention if changes could affect other parts of the codebase

Security and performance concerns
- Explicitly call out any security risks or vulnerabilities
- Flag potential performance bottlenecks
- Suggest mitigation strategies

